{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T03:52:55.229Z","ordinal":16895,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e350724b487d08024b1bc7e1bf6bf","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ghb4UjKJK8tNQcgmt9s0MHV2","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-takeover/TAKEOVER.md\\n@@\\n That cleanup and Bytes extraction are now committed and pushed as bfefd402d on origin/codex/dotfiles-one-history. lint-fix 42086 completed successfully with the 12 known dead legacy backup warnings; push 90129 completed. No running commands remain. Integration branch upstream expected head is bfefd402d; original PR heads remain as listed earlier. Continue the implementation, not a review-only pass.\\n+\\n+### Continued rewrite: portable manifest and removal of backup interfaces\\n+\\n+Current uncommitted work in dotfiles-one-history removes backup.rs/encrypted.rs/machines.rs and machine CLI, backup status/doctor/onboarding flags, per-file share/backup fields, and all machine recovery-ref constants/cleanup. Shared encryption remains in sync/files.rs. Deployment-source validation is separate required_sources bookkeeping, never enrollment. Portable layout is now home/... or config/... with @variant root suffixes, independent of deployment role. New manifest.rs records explicit enrollment, exclusions, public recipients, and all variants in the ordinary tree; capture carries inactive streams and repo-owned files from its ordinary parent, drops explicitly untracked streams. Manual/held capture paths use the selected variant. Manifest still needs portable full-permission metadata and fresh-machine import/provenance reconciliation; restore/diff callers still need variant-aware lookup. Sync state is now an atomic private JSON bookkeeping file, not refs/sync/state. Publication still uses the obsolete filtered builder and must be replaced; shared decryption still creates plaintext Git objects and must be fixed. Git notes and full sanitized checkpoint trailers also remain transitional.\\n+\\n+Ancestry audit now unions encrypted-path policies from every reachable manifest including inactive variants and merge parents. Deleted origin backup fields from schema and regenerated schema; settings descriptions no longer advertise backups. No personal stores or remote refs were removed. Latest manifest unit tests 2/2 PASS (66348), previous shadow 7/7 PASS (58168), lint-fix PASS (22961) with remaining dead legacy warnings (not Clippy clean), render:schema PASS (72866). Current e2e session16064 builds/runs explicit_tracking and one_history; poll before edits/builds. Cargo check passed but one earlier compile overlapped source edits and mbx declined caching; subsequent lint check passed fresh. Continue implementation, then PR feedback/CI/conflicts; do not stop at these intermediate milestones or claim the original PRs updated.\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","create_time":1788753157.143284}}}
