ext Git objects and must be fixed. Git notes and full sanitized checkpoint trailers also remain transitional.\n+\n+Ancestry audit now unions encrypted-path policies from every reachable manifest including inactive variants and merge parents. Deleted origin backup fields from schema and regenerated schema; settings descriptions no longer advertise backups. No personal stores or remote refs were removed. Latest manifest unit tests 2/2 PASS (66348), previous shadow 7/7 PASS (58168), lint-fix PASS (22961) with remaining dead legacy warnings (not Clippy clean), render:schema PASS (72866). Current e2e session16064 builds/runs explicit_tracking and one_history; poll before edits/builds. Cargo check passed but one earlier compile overlapped source edits and mbx declined caching; subsequent lint check passed fresh. Continue implementation, then PR feedback/CI/conflicts; do not stop at these intermediate milestones or claim the original PRs updated.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-takeover/TAKEOVER.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1788753175240,"completed_at_ms":1788753175241}}
