ontinuation adds process-local transient Git-identity blobs: hash-object without -w, in-memory cat-object reads; decrypt no longer writes plaintext/payload objects or refs/mise-decrypted-files. Sync/live rollback comparisons and text merge results use transient blobs. Old publication code materializes only accepted unencrypted changes; encrypted ones still reencrypt there pending same-DAG rewrite. Encrypted-file tests44498 running. Replay comparison change landed just after build started, so rerun verification fresh as needed. Full same-DAG publication, manifest fresh onboarding, minimal metadata/notes replacement, lifecycle recovery, permissions and variant-aware restore still outstanding. Continue without waiting for user prompt.\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","create_time":1788753601.59475}}}
