{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T04:08:38.009Z","ordinal":17241,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07177-9855-71a2-89cd-4a9a37cdbfcb","turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e38c3ff8887d08c7d5f44496dcddd","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"All six encrypted-file unit tests now pass. One caught an unnecessary key request when publishing an unrelated file; unchanged ciphertext now needs neither decryption nor a recipient-plugin call.\n\nI’ve also updated the setup guide to explicitly enroll the bootstrap config and template directory, since neither is captured automatically anymore.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788754115962,"completed_at_ms":1788754118009}}
