One caught an unnecessary key request when publishing an unrelated file; unchanged ciphertext now needs neither decryption nor a recipient-plugin call.\n\nI’ve also updated the setup guide to explicitly enroll the bootstrap config and template directory, since neither is captured automatically anymore.\n","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e38c3ff8887d08c7d5f44496dcddd","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_nrha5E9c1vLjtHk2OtiafZdt","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e38c609c487d0851068daa6c9a2f8","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"MISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS=/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.95.0 mise exec -- cargo test --locked --bin mise system::history::shadow::tests\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"MISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS=/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.95.0 mise run lint-fix\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788754111.974203,"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_nrha5E9c1vLjtHk2OtiafZdt","id":"ctco_01a07a0d-e3f0-7311-a353-7a9b8861296f","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788754125.808779,"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 2.3 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"9948bd\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.000991541,\"session_id\":58577,\"original_token_count\":52,\"output\":\"mise WARN  GitHub OAuth refresh was rejected (