nding application, not only encrypted config. Removed track --local. Generated CLI usage/docs, including removal of machine-recovery CLI page. Encrypted replay now uses restored_object_at to decrypt into transient in-process blobs for comparison and writes; actual rollback and undo PASS e2e23070 with both plaintext blob IDs absent from Git. Explicit_tracking and one_history e2es PASS39887. lint-fix62644 and render:usage6137 PASS (dead-code warnings remain, not Clippy clean). Blog PR99 branch codex/dotfiles-that-save-themselves updated in /Users/jdx/src/blog-dotfiles-history, commit72afed0 removes separate backups/local-only and describes explicit enrollment and pre-Git encryption; Hugo0.165.0 build PASS. Blog push session96894 awaiting result. Original mise PR heads untouched. Still required: complete ordinary runtime sync, manifest-only onboarding/enrollment provenance, exact managed-target CLI overlap, minimal metadata and notes removal, portable permission metadata, variant-aware replay and plaintext diff, temporary recovery lifecycle and stale recovery, obsolete dead-code cleanup, then restack/review/CI. Do not stop at this milestone; user explicitly requests finish plan then feedback/checks/conflicts.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.write_stdin({session_id:96894,chars:\"\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","create_time":1788755785.08564}}}
