{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:09:59.041Z","ordinal":18451,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e470fd16487d0a3e2598e57f18980","status":"completed","call_id":"call_89EVfUE847MCXZ8QqRTTPO0M","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n 'mod .*tests' src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\\nsed -n '100,116p' docs/dotfiles.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise\",\"max_output_tokens\":700}));\ntext(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\\n@@\\n-/// Checks that every declared entry is active and saves their baseline.\\n+#[cfg(test)]\\n+mod declaration_tests {\\n+    use super::*;\\n+\\n+    #[test]\\n+    fn failed_enrollment_restores_only_its_own_declaration_version() {\\n+        let temporary = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\\n+        let path = temporary.path().join(\\\"conf.d/dotfiles-tracking.toml\\\");\\n+        let mut edit = DeclarationEdit::read(&path).unwrap();\\n+        edit.document = \\\"[dotfiles]\\\\n\\\\\\\"~/.zshrc\\\\\\\" = { mode = \\\\\\\"track\\\\\\\" }\\\\n\\\".parse().unwrap();\\n+        edit.write(&path).unwrap();\\n+        assert!(path.exists());\\n+        std::fs::write(&path, \\\"# concurrent user edit\\\\n\\\").unwrap();\\n+        assert!(edit.restore(&path).is_err());\\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap(), \\\"# concurrent user edit\\\\n\\\");\\n+    }\\n+\\n+    #[test]\\n+    fn concurrent_edit_before_enrollment_is_not_overwritten() {\\n+        let temporary = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\\n+        let path = temporary.path().join(\\\"config.toml\\\");\\n+        let mut edit = DeclarationEdit::read(&path).unwrap();\\n+        edit.document = \\\"[dotfiles]\\\\n\\\".parse().unwrap();\\n+        std::fs::write(&path, \\\"# newly created by user\\\\n\\\").unwrap();\\n+        assert!(edit.write(&path).is_err());\\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap(), \\\"# newly created by user\\\\n\\\");\\n+    }\\n+}\\n+\\n+/// Checks that every declared entry is active and saves their baseline.\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/docs/dotfiles.md\\n@@\\n Genuine conflicts between two deployment declarations are still rejected.\\n+\\n+`mise bootstrap dotfiles track <managed-file>` keeps the deployment declaration\\n+and writes its tracking entry separately under `conf.d/dotfiles-tracking.toml`.\\n+Untracking removes the tracking entry without removing the deployment or live file.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"MISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS=/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.95.0 mise exec -- cargo fmt\\nMISE_TRUSTED_CONFIG_PATHS=/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.95.0 mise exec -- cargo test --bin mise cli::dotfiles::track::declaration_tests\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise\",\"yield_time_ms\":1000,\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","create_time":1788757770.883507}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:09:59.124Z","ordinal":18452,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07177-9855-71a2-89cd-4a9a37cdbfcb","turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-8b7d246c-303a-4298-8d35-d45f80a72988","process_id":"46497","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'mod .*tests' src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\nsed -n '100,116p' docs/dotfiles.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'mod .*tests' src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs","query":"mod .*tests","path":"track.rs"},{"type":"read","cmd":"sed -n '100,116p' docs/dotfiles.md","name":"dotfiles.md","path":"docs/dotfiles.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"`mise bootstrap dotfiles track ~/.zshrc --os macos` adds a variant. The most\nspecific matching variant wins (`profile` over an arch-qualified `os` over an\n`os` alone); two matching equally are reported as ambiguous and the path is\nleft out until fixed. A machine matching no variant does not capture or apply that path unless a\nvariant is marked `default = true`. Its commits preserve the other platforms'\nstreams without saving this machine's live file into them.\n\n### Ownership\n\nDeployment ownership and tracking observation are separate. A tracked directory\nmay contain managed files or template sources; observing them does not take\nover their deployment. Explicit tracking and a managed declaration can coexist.\nGenuine conflicts between two deployment declarations are still rejected.\n\nTracking also coexists with managed edits and shell activation:\n`mise bootstrap mise-shell-activate` can edit a tracked `~/.zshrc`.\n\n","stderr":"","aggregated_output":"`mise bootstrap dotfiles track ~/.zshrc --os macos` adds a variant. The most\nspecific matching variant wins (`profile` over an arch-qualified `os` over an\n`os` alone); two matching equally are reported as ambiguous and the path is\nleft out until fixed. A machine matching no variant does not capture or apply that path unless a\nvariant is marked `default = true`. Its commits preserve the other platforms'\nstreams without saving this machine's live file into them.\n\n### Ownership\n\nDeployment ownership and tracking observation are separate. A tracked directory\nmay contain managed files or template sources; observing them does not take\nover their deployment. Explicit tracking and a managed declaration can coexist.\nGenuine conflicts between two deployment declarations are still rejected.\n\nTracking also coexists with managed edits and shell activation:\n`mise bootstrap mise-shell-activate` can edit a tracked `~/.zshrc`.\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":2666},"formatted_output":"`mise bootstrap dotfiles track ~/.zshrc --os macos` adds a variant. The most\nspecific matching variant wins (`profile` over an arch-qualified `os` over an\n`os` alone); two matching equally are reported as ambiguous and the path is\nleft out until fixed. A machine matching no variant does not capture or apply that path unless a\nvariant is marked `default = true`. Its commits preserve the other platforms'\nstreams without saving this machine's live file into them.\n\n### Ownership\n\nDeployment ownership and tracking observation are separate. A tracked directory\nmay contain managed files or template sources; observing them does not take\nover their deployment. Explicit tracking and a managed declaration can coexist.\nGenuine conflicts between two deployment declarations are still rejected.\n\nTracking also coexists with managed edits and shell activation:\n`mise bootstrap mise-shell-activate` can edit a tracked `~/.zshrc`.\n\n"},"started_at_ms":1788757799124,"completed_at_ms":1788757799124}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:09:59.166Z","ordinal":18453,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07177-9855-71a2-89cd-4a9a37cdbfcb","turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","item":{"type":"FileChange","id":"exec-10fdc03f-17a1-45fc-a430-32f41d3ee370","changes":{"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/docs/dotfiles.md":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -113,2 +113,6 @@\n \n+`mise bootstrap dotfiles track <managed-file>` keeps the deployment declaration\n+and writes its tracking entry separately under `conf.d/dotfiles-tracking.toml`.\n+Untracking removes the tracking entry without removing the deployment or live file.\n+\n Tracking also coexists with managed edits and shell activation:\n","move_path":null},"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs":{"type":"update","unified_diff":"@@ -293,2 +293,31 @@\n \n+#[cfg(test)]\n+mod declaration_tests {\n+    use super::*;\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn failed_enrollment_restores_only_its_own_declaration_version() {\n+        let temporary = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let path = temporary.path().join(\"conf.d/dotfiles-tracking.toml\");\n+        let mut edit = DeclarationEdit::read(&path).unwrap();\n+        edit.document = \"[dotfiles]\\n\\\"~/.zshrc\\\" = { mode = \\\"track\\\" }\\n\".parse().unwrap();\n+        edit.write(&path).unwrap();\n+        assert!(path.exists());\n+        std::fs::write(&path, \"# concurrent user edit\\n\").unwrap();\n+        assert!(edit.restore(&path).is_err());\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap(), \"# concurrent user edit\\n\");\n+    }\n+\n+    #[test]\n+    fn concurrent_edit_before_enrollment_is_not_overwritten() {\n+        let temporary = tempfile::tempdir().unwrap();\n+        let path = temporary.path().join(\"config.toml\");\n+        let mut edit = DeclarationEdit::read(&path).unwrap();\n+        edit.document = \"[dotfiles]\\n\".parse().unwrap();\n+        std::fs::write(&path, \"# newly created by user\\n\").unwrap();\n+        assert!(edit.write(&path).is_err());\n+        assert_eq!(std::fs::read_to_string(&path).unwrap(), \"# newly created by user\\n\");\n+    }\n+}\n+\n /// Checks that every declared entry is active and saves their baseline.\n","move_path":null}},"status":"completed","stdout":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\nM /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-one-history/mise/docs/dotfiles.md\n","stderr":""},"started_at_ms":1788757799165,"completed_at_ms":1788757799166}}
