machine:\\n  sources: 1 file(s)\\nAgainst the repository: 1 identical, 0 differing (decided with `mise bootstrap dotfiles pull --take-remote|--keep-local`), 0 incoming to apply.\\nAll committed versions of explicitly tracked files are eligible for synchronization. Untracking does not erase earlier versions.\\nmise history: connected file:///private/var/folders/6m/23f_80p95q79kmhpm8_w50340000gn/T/test_dotfiles_ordinary_two_machine.cS0hxC/home/workdir/ordinary-origin.git (manual); [history.origin] written to ~/.config/mise/config.local.toml\\nmise history: nothing new to publish\\nSUCCESS: [b bootstrap dotfiles origin set file:///private/var/folders/6m/23f_80p95q79kmhpm8_w50340000gn/T/test_dotfiles_ordinary_two_machine.cS0hxC/home/workdir/ordinary-origin.git --sync manual --yes] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ mise bootstrap dotfiles save\\nmise history: saved checkpoint 2: edited ~/.native\\nSUCCESS: [mise bootstrap dotfiles save] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ mise bootstrap dotfiles sync\\nmise history: published 053b441\\nSUCCESS: [mise bootstrap dotfiles sync] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ b bootstrap dotfiles sync --fetch-only\\nmise history: nothing new to publish\\nmise history: 1 incoming change(s) pending; `mise bootstrap dotfiles pull` applies them\\nSUCCESS: [b bootstrap dotfiles sync --fetch-only] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ b bootstrap dotfiles pull --yes\\n~/.native  write  home/.native\\nmise history: applied 1 incoming change(s)\\nSUCCESS: [b bootstrap dotfiles pull --yes] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ cat /private/var/folders/6m/23f_80p95q79kmhpm8_w50340000gn/T/test_dotfiles_ordinary_two_machine.cS0hxC/second/.native\\nSUCCESS: [cat /private/var/folders/6m/23f_80p95q79kmhpm8_w50340000gn/T/test_dotfiles_ordinary_two_machine.cS0hxC/second/.native] output is equal to 'incoming'\\nDEBUG: $ b bootstrap dotfiles sync\\nmise history: published fb20505\\nSUCCESS: [b bootstrap dotfiles sync] expected success\\nDEBUG: $ git --git-dir=/private/var/folders/6m/23f_80p95q79k