{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:14:36.051Z","ordinal":18494,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07a4a-2a93-7170-8ee9-afde3a3ef1f6","call_id":"call_qfz8mXzvKCwV2l0WdsbEjn6c","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"346d54\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000004291,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":116,\"output\":\" M docs/dotfiles.md\\n M e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_explicit_tracking\\n M src/cli/dotfiles/track.rs\\n M src/cli/dotfiles/untrack.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/apply.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/mod.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/origin.rs\\n D src/system/history/sync/privacy.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/publish.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/reconcile.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/run.rs\\n M src/system/history/sync/share.rs\\n?? e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_ordinary_two_machine\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"write_stdin failed: Unknown process id 53550"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"94ac6a\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000001042,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1265,\"output\":\"  cargo-check – warning: function `decrypt_bytes` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/agecrypt.rs:178:21\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 178 | pub(crate) async fn decrypt_bytes(ciphertext: &[u8]) -> Result<Vec<u8>, DecryptError> {\\n  cargo-check –     |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check –     = note: `#[warn(dead_code)]` (part of `#[warn(unused)]`) on by default\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `default_identity_file` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/agecrypt.rs:221:15\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 221 | pub(crate) fn default_identity_file() -> PathBuf {\\n  cargo-check –     |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `generate_identity_file` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/agecrypt.rs:232:15\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 232 | pub(crate) fn generate_identity_file(path: &Path) -> Result<String> {\\n  cargo-check –     |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `resolve_recipient_arg` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/agecrypt.rs:296:21\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 296 | pub(crate) async fn resolve_recipient_arg(arg: &str) -> Result<Vec<String>> {\\n  cargo-check –     |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `restorability` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/agecrypt.rs:564:21\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 564 | pub(crate) async fn restorability(recipients: &[String]) -> Option<bool> {\\n  cargo-check –     |                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: methods `write_tree` and `changed_names` are never used\\n  cargo-check –     --> src/system/history/shadow.rs:406:19\\n  cargo-check –      |\\n  cargo-check –  127 | impl HistoryRepo {\\n  cargo-check –      | ---------------- methods in this implementation\\n  cargo-check – ...\\n  cargo-check –  406 |     pub(crate) fn write_tree(&self, entries: &[(String, String, String)]) -> Result<String> {\\n  cargo-check –      |                   ^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – ...\\n  cargo-check – 1143 |     pub(crate) fn changed_names(&self, commit: &str) -> Result<Vec<String>> {\\n  cargo-check –      |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `encrypt` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/system/history/sync/files.rs:211:4\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 211 | fn encrypt(\\n  cargo-check –     |    ^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `is_repository_metadata` is never used\\n  cargo-check –   --> src/system/history/sync/layout.rs:97:15\\n  cargo-check –    |\\n  cargo-check – 97 | pub(crate) fn is_repository_metadata(path: &str) -> bool {\\n  cargo-check –    |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: constant `MAX_LINK_DEPTH` is never used\\n  cargo-check –   --> src/system/history/tracked.rs:30:7\\n  cargo-check –    |\\n  cargo-check – 30 | const MAX_LINK_DEPTH: usize = 8;\\n  cargo-check –    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `is_credential_name` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/system/history/tracked.rs:652:15\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 652 | pub(crate) fn is_credential_name(name: &str) -> bool {\\n  cargo-check –     |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `normalize_missing` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/system/history/tracked.rs:802:15\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 802 | pub(crate) fn normalize_missing(path: &Path) -> PathBuf {\\n  cargo-check –     |               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: function `link_target` is never used\\n  cargo-check –    --> src/system/history/tracked.rs:823:15\\n  cargo-check –     |\\n  cargo-check – 823 | pub(crate) fn link_target(link: &Path) -> Option<PathBuf> {\\n  cargo-check –     |               ^^^^^^^^^^^\\n  cargo-check – 601 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  cargo-check – warning: `mise` (bin \\\"mise\\\") generated 12 warnings\\n  cargo-check –     Finished