{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:26:00.227Z","ordinal":18877,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07177-9855-71a2-89cd-4a9a37cdbfcb","turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9e4ae5c93887d092ca5e2415ab8482","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The rerun also exposed a nested-command deadlock: `untrack` was waiting for the lock held by its parent capture command. That’s fixed, and the test is rerunning. I’ve also corrected origin help that still mentioned recovery backups, and encryption capture now reads the repository’s saved recipients before encrypting."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788758757972,"completed_at_ms":1788758760227}}
