{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T05:32:45.086Z","ordinal":18992,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a07a5a-c89e-7e22-bfa7-17365d00e074","call_id":"call_u8v57dy1Fehs3ywwQ8qY7fHQ","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"62723e\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000002583,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":534,\"output\":\"`mise bootstrap --only dotfiles,tools`. `--only` and `--skip` are mutually\\nexclusive.\\n\\nUse `mise bootstrap --update` to refresh system package manager metadata\\nbefore installing packages (apk: `--update-cache`, apt: `apt-get update`) and\\nupdate declared repositories. Check the [repo update rules](/bootstrap/repos.html)\\nfor clean-worktree and fast-forward requirements.\\n\\nHook phases can also run before and after the built-in steps:\\n`pre-packages`, `post-packages`, `pre-repos`, `post-repos`, `pre-dotfiles`,\\n`post-dotfiles`, `pre-defaults`, `post-defaults`, `pre-user`, `post-user`,\\n`pre-tools`, and `post-tools`. Hook commands support [Tera templates](/templates.html)\\nusing the declaring config's context, including values such as\\n<code v-pre>{{ config_root }}</code>, <code v-pre>{{ xdg_config_home }}</code>,\\nand <code v-pre>{{ vars.name }}</code>.\\n\\nThe declarative steps compare the requested state with the host and apply\\nneeded changes. Hooks and the `bootstrap` task run on every selected apply, so\\nmake them safe to repeat. Bootstrap is a sequence, not a transaction: if a later\\nphase fails, earlier successful changes remain. Fix the reported failure and\\nrun bootstrap again.\\n\\n## Previewing changes\\ne2e/config/test_schema_bootstrap_hooks:30:pre-dotfiles = \\\"echo pre-dotfiles\\\"\\ne2e/config/test_schema_bootstrap_hooks:31:post-dotfiles = \\\"echo post-dotfiles\\\"\\ne2e/cli/test_dotfiles_watch_throttle:170:# The operation is an apply whose pre-dotfiles hook holds the operation lock\\ne2e/cli/test_dotfiles_watch_throttle:174:[bootstrap.hooks.pre-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:296:[bootstrap.hooks.pre-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:299:[bootstrap.hooks.post-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:328:[bootstrap.hooks.post-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:351:[bootstrap.hooks.post-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:356:post_dotfiles_message = \\\"stale-post-dotfiles\\\"\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:363:post_dotfiles_message = \\\"rendered-post-dotfiles\\\"\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:369:[bootstrap.hooks.post-dotfiles]\\ne2e/cli/test_bootstrap:380:layered_post_dotfiles_message = \\\"{{ vars.post_dotfiles_message | default(value='missing-post-dotfiles') }}\\\"\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a079e2-ddee-7920-adc1-13c441666749","create_time":1788759165.086753}}}
